OL,3,CTwo arrests after Belfast stabbing
OL,5,FTwo men have been arrested on
OL,6,Fsuspicion of attempted murder after a
OL,7,Fstabbing in Belfast.
OL,9,FA man suffered multiple puncture
OL,10,Fwounds to his chest and neck following
OL,11,Fan incident in the Fitzroy Avenue area
OL,12,Fat around 7.30pm on Wednesday.
OL,14,FA PSNI spokesperson said the victim
OL,15,Fwas also bleeding from his left ear.
OL,17,FThe spokesperson said: "He was
OL,18,Fsubsequently taken to hospital for
OL,19,Fmedical treatment for his injuries,
OL,20,Fwhich are not believed to be life-
OL,21,Fthreatening at this stage.
