OL,3,CTwo arrests after Belfast stabbing
OL,5,F"A man aged in his 20s was arrested on
OL,6,Fsuspicion of attempted murder, whilst
OL,7,Fa second man, also aged in his 20s,
OL,8,Fwas arrested on suspicion of attempted
OL,9,Fmurder, possession of an offensive
OL,10,Fweapon in a public place, and theft.
OL,12,F"They both remain in custody this
OL,13,Fmorning, Thursday August 13, as
OL,14,Fenquiries continue, and we would
OL,15,Fappeal to anyone who was in the area
OL,16,Fat the time and witnessed what
OL,17,Fhappened, or who has any information
OL,18,Fwhich might assist, to contact us."
